Most "link building statistics" posts average someone else's case studies. This one is different: it is a frozen, dated pull of Ahrefs data across 28 sites I own, taken on 24 September 2026, with every referring domain, anchor and page checked rather than assumed.

**The headline: the median owned site in this panel carries 601 referring domains and a Domain Rating of 0.6, and the anchor-text data shows most of that volume is templated PBN link-seller spam and fake review comments, not real link building.** Strip that out and the sites with genuinely earned links look nothing like the ones with the biggest numbers.

## What counts as a referring domain here, and why the raw count misleads {% #what-counts %}

A referring domain (RD) is a unique domain with at least one live link to a target, dofollow or nofollow, good or spam. Ahrefs counts it regardless of quality. That single fact makes "referring domains" a dangerous number to quote on its own, and this panel shows exactly why.

Pull the raw RD count for 28 small sites and you get a median of 601.5, a mean of 499.7 and a range from 6 to 938. Read only that and you would conclude these are well-linked sites. They are not. Median Domain Rating across the same panel is 0.6. Twenty-two of the 28 sites carry a DR under 2, the range Ahrefs treats as functionally unranked.

| Panel metric (n=28, pulled 24 September 2026) | Median | Mean | Range |
|---|---|---|---|
| Domain Rating | 0.6 | 2.1 | 0.0 – 9.0 |
| Referring domains | 602 | 500 | 6 – 938 |
| Dofollow referring domains | 51 | 87 | 3 – 349 |
| Dofollow share of referring domains | 10.5% | 22.3% | 3.4% – 66.7% |

A high RD count with a near-zero DR is not a link building result. It is a description of how much inbound spam a domain has accumulated while doing nothing to earn real links. Every one of the 28 sites in this panel had at least one referring domain; none sat at zero, so the median above is not inflated by a handful of well-linked outliers pulling up a mostly empty panel.

{% stats %}
{% stat value="0.6" label="median Domain Rating across 28 owned portfolio sites, 24 September 2026" source="Sunny Patel, Ahrefs API v3" /%}
{% stat value="10.5%" label="median dofollow share of referring domains across the same 28-site panel" source="Sunny Patel, Ahrefs API v3" /%}
